ndividual sheep. The composition is balanced, with the flock occupying the foreground and the rolling hills providing a sense of depth in the background. This pastoral scene is a beautiful depiction of nature and the simplicity of rural life, capturing both the tranquility of the moment and the endless expanse of the field.<|end_of_text|>"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 623, "label": "text", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "id": 308, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "positive", "slot_index": 0, "links": [524], "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING"}, {"name": "negative", "slot_index": 1, "links": [525], "label": "negative", "type": "CONDITIONING"}, {"name": "latent", "slot_index": 2, "links": [526], "label": "latent", "type": "LATENT"}], "size": {"0": 261.66522216796875, "1": 350}, "pos": [1613, -3797], "widgets_values": [false], "inputs": [{"name": "positive", "link": 532, "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING"}, {"name": "negative", "link": 533, "label": "negative", "type": "CONDITIONING"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 534, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE"}, {"name": "pixels", "link": 582, "label": "pixels", "type": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "mask", "link": 536, "label": "mask", "type": "MASK"}], "flags": {}, "id": 282, "type": "InpaintModelConditioning", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "InpaintModelConditioning"}, "order": 30}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": {"0": 210, "1": 246}, "pos": [1653, -3194], "inputs": [{"name": "mask", "link": 538, "label": "mask", "type": "MASK"}], "flags": {}, "id": 284, "type": "MaskPreview+", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "MaskPreview+"}, "order": 22}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": {"0": 215.36143493652344, "1": 247.60484313964844}, "pos": [988, -3194], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 630, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE"}], "flags": {}, "id": 295, "type": "PreviewImage", "prope